WEBVTT

01:40.340 --> 01:45.750
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.340 --> 01:50.970
[Episode 1]

02:03.200 --> 02:03.860
Demon Lord,

02:04.410 --> 02:05.740
the Star-Picking Tower

02:06.070 --> 02:07.870
will be completed in 10 days.

02:09.729 --> 02:10.820
Ten days?

02:12.350 --> 02:13.510
I must see

02:14.350 --> 02:17.350
the tower completed in five days.

02:20.790 --> 02:22.990
Do you understand what needs to be done?

02:23.240 --> 02:27.590
Yes, I will go capture some humans right away.

02:28.760 --> 02:30.780
[Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord from Nanchui]

03:31.650 --> 03:32.370
Huaizhu,

03:32.750 --> 03:34.960
when we came to this town last year to gather herbs,

03:34.960 --> 03:36.079
it was still very lively.

03:36.079 --> 03:37.079
The whole street was

03:37.079 --> 03:39.310
full of foreigners speaking gibberish.

03:39.310 --> 03:41.310
Why is no one here now?

03:43.430 --> 03:46.079
I heard that great demons have been coming here recently.

03:46.079 --> 03:47.140
It's not peaceful.

03:47.970 --> 03:49.460
But this inn is still here,

03:49.800 --> 03:51.530
which is somewhat surprising.

03:51.800 --> 03:53.240
You need to be careful.

03:54.800 --> 03:55.560
Don't worry.

03:55.680 --> 03:57.520
With your Demon-Slaying Fire,

03:57.560 --> 03:59.560
I'm not afraid of those evil demons.

04:00.470 --> 04:01.680
Demon-Slaying Fire?

04:02.280 --> 04:05.280
What are the people from Divine Fire Villa doing here?

04:09.350 --> 04:10.990
[Muyue Inn]

04:12.920 --> 04:17.430
[Dongfang Huaizhu from Yiqi Alliance]

04:17.970 --> 04:20.750
[Dongfang Qinlan from Yiqi Alliance]

04:21.360 --> 04:22.190
Innkeeper!

04:27.110 --> 04:29.500
Sir, two bowls of rice noodles, please.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.360
Coming.

04:34.240 --> 04:35.590
Waiter!

04:38.110 --> 04:39.310
Waiter!

04:39.750 --> 04:42.800
Two bowls of rice noodles.

04:51.630 --> 04:52.830
Ladies,

04:53.400 --> 04:55.760
have some tea first.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.510
Sir,

04:59.790 --> 05:02.430
are those demon-warding bells hanging up there?

05:02.430 --> 05:03.890
I think they rang just now.

05:08.510 --> 05:12.760
They were all left by the great demon hunters from before.

05:14.120 --> 05:16.040
Sometimes they work,

05:16.630 --> 05:18.650
sometimes they don't.

05:18.670 --> 05:20.700
Where have all the villagers gone?

05:21.190 --> 05:23.510
When my sister and I came to gather herbs last year,

05:23.510 --> 05:24.910
this place was so lively.

05:25.620 --> 05:27.690
You two don't know,

05:28.570 --> 05:29.980
but Nanchui has

05:30.070 --> 05:32.630
demons causing trouble recently.

05:33.130 --> 05:35.570
They've kidnapped many people.

05:36.870 --> 05:38.780
The villagers who could

05:39.560 --> 05:43.560
escape have all done so.

05:43.720 --> 05:44.960
What kind of demons

05:44.960 --> 05:45.960
are this bold?

05:49.980 --> 05:52.110
They're spider demons.

05:52.159 --> 05:54.600
Then why are you still staying here?

05:55.550 --> 05:57.170
If I left,

05:57.600 --> 06:01.230
where would the demon hunters stay?

06:03.400 --> 06:04.600
Don't worry, ladies.

06:04.990 --> 06:06.160
The demon hunters

06:06.480 --> 06:09.480
left me a lot of magical artifacts.

06:11.430 --> 06:15.480
This inn is safe.

06:19.550 --> 06:22.110
It's safe.

06:38.750 --> 06:40.280
Walking so stiffly,

06:41.110 --> 06:43.640
you must have just taken human form recently.

06:54.080 --> 06:55.620
Indeed, you're not an easy one.

06:55.620 --> 06:57.280
Fortunately, I was prepared.

07:13.350 --> 07:14.820
It's a ghost-faced spider?

07:14.820 --> 07:15.740
Interesting.

07:49.080 --> 07:50.680
That's the real innkeeper.

07:58.640 --> 07:59.480
Qinlan!

08:14.550 --> 08:15.480
Drop the flute,

08:15.600 --> 08:17.500
or I'll kill her.

08:35.110 --> 08:36.210
Huaizhu!

08:36.280 --> 08:37.240
How dare you play dirty tricks?

08:37.240 --> 08:38.150
Shameless!

08:41.919 --> 08:43.380
Such strong sword energy.

09:30.360 --> 09:31.380
Where...

09:32.190 --> 09:33.270
am I?

09:34.310 --> 09:35.310
Hello, miss.

09:37.000 --> 09:37.760
Are you

09:38.470 --> 09:39.280
alright?

09:53.240 --> 09:54.550
A mask.

09:55.080 --> 09:55.960
A sword.

09:57.240 --> 09:58.240
Could he be

09:59.240 --> 10:01.360
the legendary Sword Master?

10:13.590 --> 10:15.860
[Sword Master from Mask Group]

10:17.000 --> 10:18.710
There was poisonous mist on the streets.

10:18.710 --> 10:19.980
I took the liberty

10:20.190 --> 10:22.320
of bringing you to this more open area.

10:22.590 --> 10:23.190
You...

10:23.950 --> 10:25.480
Can you turn your face away?

10:30.880 --> 10:32.210
Should I thank you then?

10:32.430 --> 10:33.690
That's not necessary.

10:33.880 --> 10:35.210
But I have a favor to ask.

10:37.190 --> 10:38.990
I saw you fight with Divine Fire,

10:38.990 --> 10:41.260
so you must be Miss Dongfang.

10:43.410 --> 10:44.410
What do you want?

10:45.040 --> 10:46.040
I was hoping to...

10:49.790 --> 10:51.320
It's a bit difficult to say.

10:55.160 --> 10:55.890
How about...

11:05.790 --> 11:06.790
Sorry about that.

11:06.920 --> 11:07.760
I have an urgent need

11:07.760 --> 11:08.700
I cut off a lock of your hair today.

11:08.700 --> 11:10.300
I will repay you duly in time.

11:32.670 --> 11:34.030
Stop right there!

11:43.730 --> 11:44.520
Are you here for

11:44.520 --> 11:47.650
the great demon who's been abducting people in Nanchui?

11:48.350 --> 11:50.860
If so, do you know the demon's whereabouts?

11:53.130 --> 11:54.330
I have a general idea.

11:54.410 --> 11:56.010
It's in the mountains ahead.

11:56.160 --> 11:58.290
My sister and I often come here to gather herbs.

11:58.290 --> 11:59.840
Lilu Mountain stretches for a hundred miles.

11:59.840 --> 12:01.520
She has already pointed out the location to me.

12:01.520 --> 12:02.850
And it's quite precise.

12:03.560 --> 12:05.250
I assume you need my help.

12:07.680 --> 12:09.440
You just cut off some of my hair.

12:10.040 --> 12:11.920
You must have a plan to defeat the enemy.

12:11.920 --> 12:13.450
How about we work together?

12:16.290 --> 12:16.980
Alright.

12:17.440 --> 12:20.170
But before we go, I have three conditions for you.

12:20.990 --> 12:21.840
That's fine.

12:23.760 --> 12:24.490
One,

12:24.650 --> 12:25.730
you can't attack.

12:25.880 --> 12:26.580
Two,

12:26.800 --> 12:28.710
you must stay within 10 steps from me.

12:28.710 --> 12:29.310
Three,

12:30.320 --> 12:31.530
hold onto my scabbard

12:31.770 --> 12:32.700
and never let go.

12:33.320 --> 12:34.320
It's a deal.

12:36.770 --> 12:41.320
Someone kidnapped a beautiful young lady!

12:41.670 --> 12:45.160
Help!

12:51.130 --> 12:51.940
Huaizhu?

12:55.040 --> 12:57.770
This is where they built the Star-Picking Tower.

12:57.810 --> 12:59.090
My sister is here too.

12:59.480 --> 13:01.280
Remember our three conditions.

13:01.380 --> 13:02.710
When the battle starts,

13:02.840 --> 13:05.370
you must not be more than 10 steps away from me.

13:05.680 --> 13:06.540
Can you keep up?

13:08.560 --> 13:10.250
As long as you don't turn to face me,

13:10.250 --> 13:11.010
no problem.

13:14.610 --> 13:16.210
But the area below the clouds

13:16.440 --> 13:18.490
has been sealed with a poisonous barrier.

13:18.490 --> 13:20.020
How will you get down there?

13:21.530 --> 13:24.320
Naturally, I have my own methods.

13:58.200 --> 14:00.120
You broke through the clouds with one strike.

14:00.120 --> 14:01.370
Who exactly are you?

14:02.450 --> 14:04.780
I'm just a swordsman who likes cute masks,

14:05.390 --> 14:06.440
nothing more.

14:10.360 --> 14:14.800
[Cave Prison, Nanchui]

14:20.220 --> 14:20.940
Qinlan!

14:21.550 --> 14:22.420
Huaizhu!

14:23.270 --> 14:24.350
I'm here!

14:26.840 --> 14:28.720
Huaizhu, what took you so long?

14:28.750 --> 14:30.080
I waited for you for ages.

14:30.080 --> 14:31.160
Stop right there.

14:34.380 --> 14:36.650
[Members of Nangong Family, Yiqi Alliance]

14:36.220 --> 14:38.910
You're from the Mask Group?

14:42.710 --> 14:43.500
Indeed.

14:43.790 --> 14:46.340
The Mask Group looks down on the Yiqi Alliance.

14:46.340 --> 14:47.620
This lowly group

14:47.740 --> 14:49.240
is practically a cult.

14:49.430 --> 14:50.950
Running into us today,

14:51.470 --> 14:52.950
you're out of luck.

15:08.760 --> 15:10.980
Not exterminating demons when encountering them

15:10.980 --> 15:13.310
is considered being in cahoots with them?

15:14.590 --> 15:18.190
[Li Zizai from Mask Group]

15:20.460 --> 15:21.290
This makes us

15:21.290 --> 15:23.890
an illegal organization in the Yiqi Alliance's book?

15:22.860 --> 15:27.760
[Li Quzhuo from Mask Group]

15:25.100 --> 15:26.770
I think this Yiqi Alliance

15:27.040 --> 15:29.370
is the most tyrannical and unreasonable.

15:31.130 --> 15:32.290
Third Brother, Fourth Brother,

15:32.290 --> 15:34.340
these three noble scions say

15:34.530 --> 15:36.950
we're in trouble if we run into them.

15:38.370 --> 15:39.370
Masked brothers,

15:39.620 --> 15:40.850
they also said

15:40.880 --> 15:42.400
they're going to attack Nanchui.

15:42.400 --> 15:44.030
That's utter nonsense.

15:44.100 --> 15:45.830
We're from the Nangong family.

15:46.110 --> 15:47.650
If you dare to oppose us,

15:48.180 --> 15:49.340
you'll be sent to the Inspection Bureau

15:49.340 --> 15:50.290
to die!

15:56.130 --> 15:59.170
The abducted civilians should all be imprisoned here.

15:59.170 --> 16:00.650
Lock these three up.

16:01.130 --> 16:02.790
Rescue the rest of the people.

16:02.890 --> 16:04.150
Alright, Big Brother.

16:10.010 --> 16:11.440
Where's the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord?

16:11.440 --> 16:12.240
Take me to him.

16:14.220 --> 16:15.360
No problem.

16:15.740 --> 16:17.890
I'm just afraid you'll have the luck to get there

16:17.890 --> 16:19.010
but not to return.

16:19.940 --> 16:20.980
I'll go with you.

16:23.130 --> 16:25.460
I can't be more than 10 steps away from you.

16:25.940 --> 16:26.620
That works.

16:34.820 --> 16:36.580
What are you up to now?

16:37.460 --> 16:40.020
[Lady Poison from Nanchui]

16:38.290 --> 16:39.620
I promised you, my dear,

16:40.290 --> 16:41.860
that after you recovered from your injuries,

16:41.860 --> 16:43.250
I would give you a gift.

16:44.100 --> 16:45.650
We're not even married.

16:45.770 --> 16:47.130
Who's your dear?

16:48.010 --> 16:49.980
If you see this gift,

16:50.770 --> 16:52.650
you'll surely agree to marry me.

17:05.880 --> 17:08.440
[Star-Picking Tower, Nanchui]

17:13.170 --> 17:15.130
I've only been to your home three times.

17:15.130 --> 17:17.190
I couldn't remember all the details.

17:17.619 --> 17:18.390
But I found

17:18.410 --> 17:20.810
the blueprints of your family's building.

17:20.970 --> 17:22.369
This Star-Picking Tower

17:22.730 --> 17:25.460
should be exactly the same as your home back then.

18:27.620 --> 18:30.120
[Nangong Chui, Young Master of Nangong Family, Yiqi Alliance]

18:28.770 --> 18:30.730
Kill!

18:33.320 --> 18:36.520
You're remembering painful memories again, aren't you?

18:41.080 --> 18:44.280
Our clan leader was obsessed with building towers.

18:45.180 --> 18:48.370
Sometimes he would steal timber from the Nangong family.

18:48.370 --> 18:50.890
But we never killed any of them.

18:51.450 --> 18:52.710
I don't understand...

18:55.410 --> 18:57.170
Why did the Nangong family

18:58.090 --> 18:59.750
exterminate our entire clan?

19:05.440 --> 19:06.900
Let me show you something.

19:11.080 --> 19:14.450
I captured people from the Nangong family to build the Star-Picking Tower.

19:14.450 --> 19:15.600
After it was built,

19:15.630 --> 19:17.140
I killed them all

19:18.450 --> 19:20.210
and used their bones and weapons

19:20.210 --> 19:21.270
to make bone bells.

19:22.210 --> 19:23.210
Do you like it?

19:24.410 --> 19:26.450
You killed so many people from the Nangong family.

19:26.450 --> 19:28.840
There are even more on the cliff outside the tower.

19:28.840 --> 19:30.250
Nangong Ye's head

19:30.360 --> 19:32.600
will hang up here too one day.

19:33.360 --> 19:36.360
But won't doing this bring trouble?

19:36.560 --> 19:37.560
Of course it will.

19:42.460 --> 19:44.320
So you are the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord?

19:44.320 --> 19:45.500
Who are you two?

19:45.640 --> 19:48.370
How dare you trespass Nanchui's forbidden area?

20:06.730 --> 20:08.360
Your skills are quite impressive.

20:08.360 --> 20:10.090
You're from the Yiqi Alliance.

20:38.770 --> 20:40.370
You dare to hurt Lady Poison?

20:41.320 --> 20:43.640
You really must be tired of living.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.360
Hundred-Eyed Barrier?

21:04.130 --> 21:06.560
Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord, the Spider Demon King of Nanchui,

21:06.560 --> 21:07.840
has a body full of golden eyes.

21:07.840 --> 21:09.690
Each golden eye has 100 years of cultivation

21:09.690 --> 21:10.800
and has strong demonic energy.

21:10.800 --> 21:11.800
Able to seize souls,

21:11.800 --> 21:13.250
he dominates Nanchui.

21:14.010 --> 21:16.880
But today, the descendant of the Dongfang Divine Fire is here.

21:16.880 --> 21:18.540
Your kryptonite has arrived.

21:31.920 --> 21:32.950
Demon Lord!

21:36.080 --> 21:37.940
What magical artifact did you use

21:37.970 --> 21:40.370
to destroy my thousand-year demonic eyes?

21:41.530 --> 21:44.360
It's just a handful of Miss Dongfang's hair.

21:45.840 --> 21:47.410
Dongfang Divine Fire...

21:52.170 --> 21:53.450
Take care, everyone.

21:53.930 --> 21:55.770
We do good deeds without leaving our names.

21:55.770 --> 21:57.600
If you insist on remembering our kindness,

21:57.600 --> 22:02.460
just remember to spread the word about the two young heroines from the Dongfang family.

22:02.490 --> 22:03.600
Thank you, thank you.

22:03.600 --> 22:04.170
It's nothing.

22:04.170 --> 22:05.630
We saved all these people.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.280
We dealt with all those bad guys.

22:07.280 --> 22:09.940
Masked brother, are you trying to steal my credit?

22:09.940 --> 22:10.530
You...

22:10.970 --> 22:11.850
No.

22:12.040 --> 22:15.040
Of course, the young heroine from the Dongfang family deserve all the credit.

22:15.040 --> 22:15.880
See?

22:16.080 --> 22:19.600
This masked brother has a beautiful heart and face.

22:22.800 --> 22:24.220
Let's stay here

22:24.280 --> 22:26.580
and wait for my sister and your big brother to return.

22:26.580 --> 22:27.840
We'll wait patiently.

22:27.990 --> 22:29.790
Let them face the enemy together

22:29.880 --> 22:32.280
and give them a chance to develop their feelings.

22:32.280 --> 22:35.210
The Demon Lord built this Star-Picking Tower for me.

22:35.320 --> 22:37.780
If you insist on paying with someone's life,

22:38.010 --> 22:39.510
then take mine.

22:39.640 --> 22:40.410
Lady Poison.

22:43.160 --> 22:45.090
Humans are the most cold-blooded.

22:45.250 --> 22:47.510
Talking to them about loyalty and reason

22:47.690 --> 22:48.560
is futile.

22:48.600 --> 22:50.880
Even if you have a long-standing grudge against the Yiqi Alliance,

22:50.880 --> 22:52.700
those civilians you kidnapped

22:52.930 --> 22:54.040
were innocent.

22:57.550 --> 22:58.780
Innocent?

23:00.840 --> 23:02.410
Do you know how many of my people

23:02.410 --> 23:05.010
originally lived in this Star-Picking Tower?

23:05.970 --> 23:08.830
Four thousand eight hundred and seventy-one.

23:09.040 --> 23:10.490
During that massacre,

23:11.410 --> 23:13.250
fire burned for seven days.

23:14.150 --> 23:16.480
Their bodies were completely destroyed.

23:16.560 --> 23:18.080
Were they guilty?

23:29.010 --> 23:29.820
Sister,

23:29.840 --> 23:30.980
go!

23:38.010 --> 23:39.320
My parents,

23:39.450 --> 23:42.450
and my brother who had only transformed for 10 days...

23:43.640 --> 23:45.090
Were they guilty?

23:45.210 --> 23:47.030
What crime did we commit?

23:47.320 --> 23:48.210
Our crime

23:49.530 --> 23:50.770
was merely cutting down

23:50.770 --> 23:53.170
one of Master Nangong's Golden Nanmu tree.

23:53.970 --> 23:56.430
It was his precious wood for making coffins.

23:57.170 --> 23:58.980
It's just a box for the dead,

23:59.080 --> 24:00.780
yet it cost us 5,000 lives.

24:01.280 --> 24:03.040
In the eyes of you humans,

24:03.300 --> 24:04.770
being born a demon

24:05.930 --> 24:07.410
is our crime.

24:10.970 --> 24:12.170
When I kill humans,

24:12.690 --> 24:13.800
I'm cruel.

24:14.800 --> 24:16.640
Lady Poison's clan was peaceful

24:17.090 --> 24:18.340
and was slaughtered.

24:18.800 --> 24:20.000
If I have to choose...

24:23.180 --> 24:24.660
I'll choose cruelty.

24:25.930 --> 24:27.800
When the Yiqi Alliance attacks Nanchui,

24:27.800 --> 24:29.730
and the demons in your territory die miserably,

24:29.730 --> 24:31.170
can you truly bear

24:31.530 --> 24:33.280
such a heavy price?

24:36.800 --> 24:38.180
[To the Yiqi Alliance Leader]

24:39.010 --> 24:40.620
This is Nangong Ye's

24:40.040 --> 24:40.770
[Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord of Star-Picking Tower in Nanchui led his demons to kill and capture Nanchui civilians]

24:40.690 --> 24:41.880
request to the leader of the Yiqi Alliance

24:40.840 --> 24:44.060
[Alliance Leader, please allow us to mobilize the forces of Yiqi Alliance to attack Nanchui and purge the demons. From Nangong Ye.]

24:41.880 --> 24:43.530
to attack Nanchui?

24:44.320 --> 24:45.640
The Nangong family, for the sake of a coffin,

24:45.640 --> 24:47.770
massacred Lady Poison's entire clan.

24:48.010 --> 24:49.840
You've killed so many of his people.

24:49.840 --> 24:51.080
Do you think this

24:51.110 --> 24:53.770
isn't enough for all of Nanchui to pay with their lives?

24:53.770 --> 24:55.040
Who exactly are you?

24:56.410 --> 24:58.250
And where did this document come from?

24:58.250 --> 24:59.490
That's not important.

24:59.490 --> 25:02.140
What's important is whether you believe it or not.

25:02.140 --> 25:04.600
The Nangong family has absolute power in the Yiqi Alliance.

25:04.600 --> 25:06.430
Every word in this document

25:06.640 --> 25:08.130
will become reality.

25:08.210 --> 25:10.170
You may not be afraid of the Nangong family,

25:10.170 --> 25:13.570
but what if the entire elite force of the Yiqi Alliance comes?

25:21.800 --> 25:23.080
You came to find me

25:23.770 --> 25:25.220
just to say these things?

25:25.280 --> 25:25.930
No.

25:27.440 --> 25:29.080
I came to kill you,

25:29.610 --> 25:31.070
Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord.

25:31.490 --> 25:34.040
If I were to use your demon core to save your Nanchui,

25:34.040 --> 25:34.570
would you

25:35.010 --> 25:36.010
dare give it t ome?

25:36.640 --> 25:38.600
How could a human possibly save demons?

25:38.600 --> 25:40.280
The Nangong family is not innocent,

25:40.280 --> 25:42.410
and neither are you, Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord.

25:42.410 --> 25:43.560
The ones I want to save

25:43.560 --> 25:46.220
are the innocent ones mentioned by Lady Poison.

25:46.320 --> 25:47.580
I hope their brethren,

25:47.600 --> 25:48.570
their parents,

25:48.800 --> 25:51.170
their younger siblings who have just transformed,

25:51.170 --> 25:51.930
won't die.

25:56.880 --> 25:58.010
Although I am human,

25:58.600 --> 25:59.840
not every human

26:00.790 --> 26:01.940
is like Nangong.

26:09.360 --> 26:11.170
Audacious humans,

26:11.280 --> 26:14.140
how dare you cause trouble in my Nanchui territory?

26:14.770 --> 26:18.170
Have you considered the consequences of being obliterated?

26:18.560 --> 26:21.230
This demonic energy is far stronger than the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord's.

26:21.230 --> 26:22.840
It's the Nanchui Poison King.

26:22.840 --> 26:24.500
Quickly, leave the building!

26:32.680 --> 26:35.100
[Huandu Qingtian, Nanchui Poison King]

26:38.380 --> 26:39.850
With such demonic aura,

26:40.250 --> 26:42.490
may I ask if you are the Nanchui Poison King,

26:42.490 --> 26:43.950
Huandu Qingtian?

26:44.010 --> 26:46.440
Causing trouble in my Nanchui territory,

26:46.840 --> 26:50.370
you even dared to touch my nephew, the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord.

26:50.450 --> 26:51.010
You,

26:51.280 --> 26:52.360
and you,

26:52.730 --> 26:53.820
must all die.

26:57.560 --> 26:59.400
Such strong demonic energy.

26:59.490 --> 27:01.550
Is this the Hundred-Eyed Demon Lord?

27:01.890 --> 27:03.320
Is he this powerful?

27:03.360 --> 27:04.220
Miss Dongfang,

27:04.800 --> 27:06.080
please stay here.

27:08.220 --> 27:09.060
Be careful!

27:25.360 --> 27:26.800
Dongfang Divine Fire!

27:30.040 --> 27:31.770
Let me borrow your Divine Fire.

27:48.680 --> 27:50.030
Young one,

27:50.340 --> 27:51.540
you have some skills.

27:51.750 --> 27:53.480
But compared to me,

27:53.750 --> 27:54.550
you're still two

27:54.550 --> 27:57.480
or 3,000 years of cultivation and experience short.

28:00.820 --> 28:02.270
Retreat quickly.

28:02.350 --> 28:05.180
You can't take my nephew's demon core away.

28:05.480 --> 28:07.400
Come out now, or are you seeking death?

28:07.400 --> 28:08.500
Coming!

28:10.070 --> 28:11.000
Fourth Brother,

28:11.150 --> 28:12.820
the swords you make are getting worse.

28:12.820 --> 28:13.750
Big Brother,

28:13.880 --> 28:14.920
be reasonable.

28:15.000 --> 28:17.720
This sword could block one attack from old Huandu.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.720
It's good enough.

28:18.920 --> 28:21.350
This Nanchui Poison King's toxic miasma has been refined for 1,000 years.

28:21.350 --> 28:22.750
It's indeed formidable.

28:23.310 --> 28:24.440
If that's the case,

28:25.200 --> 28:27.320
let's fight our way out.

28:27.480 --> 28:29.160
Such big words.

28:31.000 --> 28:31.960
Let's see

28:32.000 --> 28:34.330
if you can break through this move of mine.

28:37.830 --> 28:39.530
Third Brother, help me out.

28:39.680 --> 28:40.440
I'm coming!

28:55.130 --> 28:55.810
Freeze!

28:58.030 --> 28:58.870
As expected.

28:59.000 --> 29:00.640
Even with a body of all poisons,

29:00.640 --> 29:02.400
it still operates on the basis of qi circulation.

29:02.400 --> 29:03.720
As long as we lock the qi channels,

29:03.720 --> 29:06.030
we can temporarily restrain the old demon's attacks.

29:06.030 --> 29:06.960
Old Huandu,

29:07.200 --> 29:08.860
what other tricks do you have?

29:09.240 --> 29:10.400
Ignorant fools.

29:13.310 --> 29:14.390
Again?

29:14.800 --> 29:16.670
How many more tricks do you have?

29:19.510 --> 29:21.370
Fourth Brother, draw your sword!

29:21.480 --> 29:22.180
Seal!

29:22.240 --> 29:22.750
Break!

29:23.270 --> 29:24.070
Spirit Shell,

29:24.110 --> 29:24.860
open!

29:25.300 --> 29:26.960
Big Brother, catch the sword!

29:29.960 --> 29:30.690
This is good.

29:30.790 --> 29:32.050
It'll be my main sword.

29:32.940 --> 29:33.820
Big Brother,

29:34.030 --> 29:35.520
here's a bottle of wine.

29:35.750 --> 29:36.880
You understand me.

29:40.790 --> 29:42.240
Miss, stay calm.

29:42.350 --> 29:43.870
Although I don't know if it will work,

29:43.870 --> 29:45.440
let me give it my all first.

29:58.480 --> 29:59.680
The spirit swords have merged.

29:59.680 --> 30:01.200
Just one more breakthrough to go.

30:01.200 --> 30:04.450
Then I'll break through your Xuanwu position first.

30:10.000 --> 30:11.110
Third Brother, Fourth Brother,

30:11.110 --> 30:12.260
take the lady and leave first.
